---
import { LogIn } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<footer class="bg-[#07090F] border-t border-slate-800/80 py-16 text-slate-400 text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-slate-800/60">
      <!-- Brand & Description -->
      <div class="space-y-3 text-center md:text-left max-w-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" class="w-5 h-5">
              <path d="M8 11.5h16M8 16h16M8 20.5h11" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">GRANETE</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          La plataforma operativa que conecta venta comercial, diseño 3D en SketchUp, ingeniería paramétrica y piso de taller para carpinterías y fábricas de muebles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-8 font-medium text-slate-300">
        <a href="#problema" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">El Problema</a>
        <a href="#flujo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">El Hilo Digital</a>
        <a href="#capacidades" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Capacidades</a>
        <a href="#comparativa" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Comparativa</a>
        <a href="#roles" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Para Quién</a>
        <a href="https://app.granete.com/login" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">
          <LogIn class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          <span>Acceso Clientes</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom credits -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Granete. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <span>Diseñado para la industria de la madera y amoblamientos</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

